{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21390","headline":"与杨十二巨源卢十九经济同游大安亭各赋二物各爲五韵探得松石 · 元稹","name":"与杨十二巨源卢十九经济同游大安亭各赋二物各爲五韵探得松石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片石与孤松，曾经物外逢。\n月临栖鹤影，云抱老人峰。\n蜀客君当问，秦官我旧封。\n积膏当琥珀，新劫长芙蓉。\n待补苍苍去，樛柯早变龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}